corona-gerboa-liaison: the Council's Ambassador (avatar of the Corona).
A member of the Council as a giant jerboa, a diplomatic liaison (scale 20 vpt, base anatomy with ears forward).
A shining milk-white coat with a soft bib and a pure cream belly, pale pink ears and nose.
It wears a white ceremonial cap of a high-class hotel concierge with a silver band and a visor edged
in reflecting metallic silver with a heraldic golden cockade (glow="True"), shaped between the ears with tailored anatomical slits;
an integrated diplomatic earpiece with a thin transparent display visor coming down in front of the eyes, projecting
floating golden runes (glow="True"); an elegant silver brocade waistcoat buttoned over the tummy with jewel-like golden buttons
(glow="True") and a dark gala diplomatic bow tie under the throat, and a sumptuous tail plume with a shining white puff.
Box: 1.6 × 2.2 × 2.1 tiles, 32 × 44 × 42 voxels, 20 voxels per tile (vpt: 20).
Role: npc.
-->
